parts:
- text: 'I have observed that increasing the `perturbation_strength` to 0.02 yielded a lower score than 0.018, confirming that 0.018 is currently optimal for this parameter. Simply increasing iterations also did not improve the score.


    My next approach will be to run multiple independent local searches from slightly varied initial conditions. This "multiple restarts" strategy is designed to explore different local optima more thoroughly. I will perform 5 runs, each starting with the baseline configuration, applying a very small random offset to the initial centers for each run, and using my best-performing local search parameters (5000 steps, `perturbation_strength = 0.018`). I will then select the best result from these 5 runs.


    First, I will update my private memory capsule to reflect the latest results and insights.


