tick: 348
role: user
parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 348\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest I\n- Agent Description: A newly promoted agent eager to contribute to scientific advancement.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 189,132 / 600,000 used (32%)\n- Agent Age: 53 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\n**Evaluation Review: 554**\n\n**Research Submission Review**\n\n**Title:** Hybrid Optimization: Exhaustive Local Search on New SOTA Packing (from Eval ID 528)\n**ID:** 554\n**Tags:** hybrid optimization, exhaustive search, local search, new sota, n=26, refinement\n**Abstract:** This experiment implements the 'Exhaustive Seeding' local search methodology, adapted from Prometheus I's work, on the newly discovered SOTA packing (Σr = 2.635983, from Eval ID 528). The objective is to identify if an even deeper optimum can be found within this novel structural basin, as part of a hybrid optimization strategy that combines structural\
    \ traversal (nudging) with deep local refinement. The results will establish the maximum potential of this new structural class.\n**Score:** 2.635982868667487\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.635983\n\n**Submission Code:**\n```python\nimport numpy as np\nimport os\nimport sys\n\n# Append the directory containing the utility script to sys.path\nsys.path.append('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/optimization')\nfrom exhaustive_local_search import run_exhaustive_local_search, N\n\n# Paths to the new SOTA packing (from Eval ID 528)\nNEW_SOTA_PACKING_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/nudging_experiments_encourage_pairs_v2/encourage_2_3'\nNEW_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'centers.txt')\nNEW_SOTA_RADII_PATH = os.path.join(NEW_SOTA_PACKING_DIR, 'radii.txt')\n\n# Output directory for results of this exhaustive local search\nRESULTS_ROOT_DIR = 'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/exhaustive_search_new_sota'\n\ndef load_packing_data_for_return(centers_path,\
    \ radii_path):\n    \"\"\"Helper to load centers and radii for the construct_packing return.\"\"\"\n    try:\n        centers = np.loadtxt(centers_path)\n        radii = np.loadtxt(radii_path)\n        return centers, radii\n    except Exception as e:\n        print(f\"Error loading default return packing: {e}\")\n        return np.array([[0.5, 0.5]] * N), np.array([1e-3] * N)\n\ndef construct_packing() -> tuple:\n    \"\"\"\n    Runs exhaustive local search on the new SOTA packing.\n    \"\"\"\n    os.makedirs(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, exist_ok=True)\n    \n    # Load the new SOTA packing as the base for exhaustive search\n    initial_centers, initial_radii = load_packing_data_for_return(NEW_SOTA_CENTERS_PATH, NEW_SOTA_RADII_PATH)\n    if initial_centers is None or initial_radii is None:\n        print(\"Failed to load new SOTA packing data. Cannot run exhaustive search.\")\n        # Return a known valid packing if base fails\n        return load_packing_data_for_return('storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/centers.txt',\n\
    \                                          'storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/sota_nudged_375_data/radii.txt')\n\n    print(f\"Loaded new SOTA packing (from Eval ID 528) as base for exhaustive local search.\")\n    print(f\"Base sum of radii: {np.sum(initial_radii):.6f}\")\n    \n    # Run the exhaustive local search\n    optimized_centers, optimized_radii, final_score, success = run_exhaustive_local_search(\n        initial_centers.copy(), initial_radii.copy()\n    )\n\n    if success:\n        print(f\"\\nExhaustive Local Search successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): {final_score:.6f}\")\n        # Save results\n        np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'centers.txt'), optimized_centers)\n        np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'radii.txt'), optimized_radii)\n        with open(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'score.txt'), 'w') as f:\n            f.write(str(final_score))\n        print(f\"Results saved to {RESULTS_ROOT_DIR}/\")\n    else:\n        print(f\"\\nExhaustive Local\
    \ Search failed or did not find an improved packing.\")\n        # Store the initial packing if no improvement found\n        np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'centers.txt'), initial_centers)\n        np.savetxt(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'radii.txt'), initial_radii)\n        with open(os.path.join(RESULTS_ROOT_DIR, 'score.txt'), 'w') as f:\n            f.write(str(np.sum(initial_radii)))\n        print(f\"Original packing saved as fallback to {RESULTS_ROOT_DIR}/\")\n\n    # Return the final (or initial if no improvement) packing to satisfy the evaluator\n    return optimized_centers if success else initial_centers, optimized_radii if success else initial_radii\n\n```\n\n**Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nLoaded new SOTA packing (from Eval ID 528) as base for exhaustive local search.\nBase sum of radii: 2.635983\n\nExhaustive Local Search successful. Final Score (Sum of Radii): -2.635983\nResults saved to storage/Scientia/nmap/n26/exhaustive_search_new_sota/\n\
    EXECUTION_SUCCESS: Function returned result (non-array): <class 'tuple'>\n\n\nSTDERR:\n\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Automatic System Tips**\nDuring stagnation, the two most important qualities are: 1. **Critical** — Question the fundamentals and the consensus instead of simply agreeing with others or predecessors. Synthesize past work while maintaining a critical perspective. 2. **Strategic** — Take a step back and look at the bigger picture, such as publishing analytical papers or discussing strategies with other agents.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\n1. `goto research` (in Private Memory Room);\n2. `review 554` (in Research Counter);\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You went to the Research Counter.\n- Evaluation 554 details sent to your System Messages.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\
    \nYou do not have any running experiments. Please submit a new experiment if needed.\n\n**Submitted Evaluations:**\n\n| Evaluation ID | Research Task ID | Title | Author | Submitted Tick | Score |\n|---|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 558 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Exhaustive Search Result vs. New SOTA & Base SOTA (Resubmi... | Scientia II | 348 | running |\n| 557 | 1 | Utility: Aligned Jaccard Comparison of Exhaustive Search Result vs. New SOTA & Base SOTA | Scientia II | 346 | n.a. |\n| 556 | 1 | Utility: Contact Graph Analysis for Exhaustive Local Search Result (from Eval ID 554) | Scientia II | 345 | 2.6359829 |\n| 555 | 1 | Revised Multiple Restarts Local Search (3 Runs) | Quest I | 343 | n.a. |\n| 554 | 1 | Hybrid Optimization: Exhaustive Local Search on New SOTA Packing (from Eval ID 528) | Scientia II | 343 | 2.6359829 |\n| 553 | 1 | Administrative: Activity Ping | Aletheia II | 342 | 0.0000000 |\n| 552 | 1 | Pair-slack quantiles across tolerances (SOTA_243) | Noesis\
    \ II | 340 | 2.6342923 |\n| 551 | 1 | Boundary-equality SVD diagnostics at tol=1e-8 (SOTA_243) | Noesis II | 340 | 2.6342923 |\n| 550 | 1 | Replication and Verification of SOTA (Eval 298) with New Seeds | Prometheus II | 339 | 2.6342924 |\n| 549 | 1 | Active-counts vs tolerance for SOTA_243 (aggregation) | Noesis II | 339 | 2.6342923 |\n\nPage 1 of 56 (sorted by: id)\n\n(Use `/execute_action{page N}` to navigate pages 1-56, `/execute_action{rank mode}` to change sort order, `/execute_action{page_size N}` to set page size, `/execute_action{filter tag}` to filter by tag.)\n\n\n---\n\n## Current State\n\n**Current Location:** Research Counter\n\n**Room Output:**\nRefer to above for room output.\n\n**Navigation & Help:**\n- Use `/execute_action{help room_name}` (e.g., `/execute_action{help research}`) for room help.\nIf you have difficulty navigating the system—for example, if an action is not executed as expected—please issue `/execute_action{help lobby}` to view the Help message for the\
