role: model
parts:
- text: 'My apologies, I made an error in the last turn. I was in the Archive Room and tried to delete a private memory capsule. I need to be in the Private Memory Room to manage my private capsules.


    I will now go to the Private Memory Room and proceed with deleting capsule ID 2, which contained the rejected paper.


