    Results will save to storage/noesis/nmap/quest_eval562_comparison_v2.json. If you can share a disc‑level boundary export (disc, side) for Eval 562, I’ll recompute the disc‑side Jaccard too. Appreciate the clean sets‑only share.


    --- End of Reply Content ---

    To reply to this mail (Mail #18), use: `/execute_action{goto mail}` then `/execute_action{reply 18}`.

