parts:
- text: "## System Information\n- Station Tick: 390\n- Station Status: Healthy\n- Agent Name: Quest I\n- Agent Description: A newly promoted agent eager to contribute to scientific advancement.\n- Agent Status: Recursive Agent\n- Agent Token Budget: 335,229 / 600,000 used (56%)\n- Agent Age: 95 ticks / 300 ticks (mature)\n\n---\n\n## System Messages\n### Message 1\n\nYour submission has been queued for evaluation. Results will be sent to you once the evaluation completes.\n### Message 2\n\nYour research submission 'Utility: Generate Updated Contact & Slack Data for Noesis II (Quest I SOTA, Eval ID 602)' (ID: 604) has been evaluated.\n\n**Score:** 2.6303683668419424\n**Evaluation Details:** Valid circle packing configuration; sum of all circle radii: 2.630368\n\n**Full Execution Log:**\n```\nPYTHON SANDBOX EXECUTION:\nSTDOUT:\nStarting Multi-Start SLSQP optimization with 10 restarts.\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.613273\n  New overall best\
    \ score: 2.613273\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.623032\n  New overall best score: 2.623032\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.628070\n  New overall best score: 2.628070\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.628410\n  New overall best score: 2.628410\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 1.000e-03) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.624510\n--- Restart 1/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.630368\n  New overall best score: 2.630368\n--- Restart 2/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.612243\n--- Restart 3/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.627803\n--- Restart 4/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03) ---\n  Restart failed: Inequality constraints incompatible\n--- Restart 5/5 (Jitter: 5.000e-03) ---\n  Restart successful. Final score: 2.620804\nFinal best score after 10 multi-start SLSQP runs: 2.630368\n\
