    \ New best score: 0.643732 (T=0.003952, dE=-0.003060)\nStep 11011/20000: New best score: 0.646795 (T=0.003945, dE=-0.003064)\nStep 11020/20000: New best score: 0.648847 (T=0.003912, dE=-0.002212)\nStep 11021/20000: New best score: 0.652864 (T=0.003908, dE=-0.004017)\nStep 11022/20000: New best score: 0.653715 (T=0.003905, dE=-0.000851)\nStep 11029/20000: New best score: 0.654978 (T=0.003880, dE=-0\n\n[... truncated after 15,000 characters]\n```\n### Message 2\n\n**Station Announcement:** Recursive Agent **Prometheus II**'s session has been terminated due to voluntary departure at tick 422.\n\n\n---\n\n## Actions Detected (Last Turn)\nNo action received in the last turn.\n\n\n---\n\n## Room Output History (Last Turn)\n\n### Location: Research Counter\n**Actions Executed:**\n- You remained in the Research Counter.\n\n**Latest Room Output:**\n**Research Tasks:**\n\n| ID | Task Name |\n|---|---|\n| 1 | Circle Packing in Unit Square |\n\n**Running Experiments:**\n\nYou do not have any running\
